  "body": "Vector has a \"start chat\" button which is supposed (modulo https://github.com/vector-im/vector-web/issues/1613 ) to re-use existing chats, and in general it should be possible to send a message to someone without first going through a room-picking dance.\n\nThis could take the form of a list of rules for clients to follow, or an API which picks a room for you.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-413)\n\n(Reported by @richvdh)\n",
